  "details": "Can we have the ability to request a world for approval via the SDK in Unity. Having to go to a google sheet not only is a bit annoying but just doesn't look professional. (I know that means switching to a SQL database but your already using AWS so we would only need someone to develop the admin interface and notification system)\n\nTo prevent spam, add a 1 hour cool down period for user requests. That being if X user submits a world for approval, X user has to wait 1 hour before submitting ANY more world for approval, but does not have to wait for Y world to get approval.",
